@startuml SEQ_15_MELIHAT_DAFTAR_KEGIATAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title SEQ-15 · Melihat Daftar Kegiatan (View-Only)\nAktor: Dosen / Kadep

actor       "Dosen / Kadep"            as Actor
boundary    "Browser"                  as Browser
control     "KegiatanController"       as Controller
entity      "Kegiatan Model"           as Model
database    "kegiatan"                 as DB

note over Actor, DB : auth:sanctum | role: dosen, kadep\nView-only — tidak ada aksi CRUD / peserta / sertifikat

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Skenario A: Melihat Daftar Kegiatan ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Actor   ->  Browser    : Buka menu Kegiatan
Browser ->  Controller : GET /kegiatan\n[auth:sanctum | role:dosen,kadep]

activate Controller
Controller -> Controller : authorize: can('viewAny', Kegiatan)\n(policy: izinkan dosen, kadep)

alt Tidak punya hak akses
    Controller --> Browser : 403 Forbidden
    Browser --> Actor      : Halaman "Akses Ditolak"
else Berhak melihat
    Controller -> Model    : with(['kepengurusan','peserta','dokumentasi'])\n.latest()->paginate()
    activate Model
    Model -> DB : SELECT kegiatan\n  JOIN kepengurusan, peserta, dokumentasi\nORDER BY tanggal_mulai DESC
    DB --> Model : daftar kegiatan (paginated)
    deactivate Model

    Controller --> Browser : Inertia::render('Kegiatan/Index', [\n  kegiatans,\n  filters,\n  viewOnly: true\n])
    Browser --> Actor      : Daftar kegiatan:\n- Filter by: status, tanggal, lab\n- Tombol "Lihat Detail" saja\n- Tidak ada tombol Tambah / Setujui / Tolak / Hapus
end
deactivate Controller

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Skenario B: Melihat Detail Kegiatan ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Actor   ->  Browser    : Klik "Lihat Detail" pada salah satu kegiatan
Browser ->  Controller : GET /kegiatan/{id}\n[auth:sanctum | role:dosen,kadep]

activate Controller
Controller -> Controller : authorize: can('view', kegiatan)
Controller -> Model      : findOrFail(id)\n->load(['kepengurusan','peserta.profile',\n         'dokumentasi','disetujuiOleh'])
activate Model
Model -> DB : SELECT kegiatan WHERE id = ?\n  JOIN semua relasi
DB --> Model : detail kegiatan lengkap
deactivate Model

Controller --> Browser : Inertia::render('Kegiatan/Show', [\n  kegiatan,\n  viewOnly: true\n])
Browser --> Actor      : Detail kegiatan:\n- Info tanggal, lokasi, deskripsi\n- Daftar peserta, dokumentasi\n- Status (diajukan / disetujui / ditolak)\n- Tidak ada aksi setujui / tolak / edit / peserta
deactivate Controller

@enduml
